{
  "_doc": [
    "Thanquol's Masterplans (assist/masterplans.py), player request 2026-10-18: the assistant runs Steal-Take plans on every free Underling and buys Clan Scruten Secrets for Kill-Stab and Steal-Take, in shop_order. Kill-Stab plans are the player's: never started, completed or abandoned by the assistant.",
    "Runs at Build & End Turn only (automation.json schedule), so Underlings you send on a Kill-Stab during your turn are never taken first.",
    "Single player and multiplayer are played the same (player rule, 2026-10-18): nothing here depends on the mode, a turn number or a story mission. What is unlocked is read from the game each time: the Masterplans button, which Underlings are unlocked, free or resting, whether Steal-Take is offered, and which Secrets shops and lines are open. Whatever unlocks later (by story in single player, by turn in multiplayer) is used from the turn it appears."
  ],
